			"notes": "### SkyBlock Wrapped\n\n- Added monthly **SkyBlock Wrapped** recaps with stats from your recent gameplay\n- Previous months are saved in a **Wrapped Archive** and can be viewed later\n- Wrapped becomes available once the month has ended\n- You can export your Wrapped's to a PDF.\n\n### Secret Room Timer\n\n- Improved secret detection reliability\n- Fixed this module not being compatible with other mods that modify mixins\n- Fixed runs being invalidated by false teammate detections\n\n### Inventory Layouts\n\n- Improved reliability of the **Layouts** inventory button (It didn't work sometimes in combination with other mods)\n- When a layout is active, the button now changes to **Stop Layout**\n- Added a clickable **[Stop]** option in chat after loading a layout"
		},
