			"notes": "### Party Safety\n\n- Added Party Safety to prevent newly joined party members (~15s joined recently) from using commands such as `!pt` to make another mod automatically transfer them party leadership.\n<i>I got this idea while queueing for M7, when a player joined, took party lead, and kicked everyone out of the party.</i>\n- Manually entered transfers are not checked.\n\n### Inventory Layouts\n\n- Improved layout tooltips to show only the information relevant to the selected layout\n- Updated the progress HUD to be movable through `/nsm gui`\n- Improved ghost item previews so custom Skyblock items keep their correct appearance even when they are no longer in your inventory\n- Wrong items now stay visible in their slot while still being marked as incorrect\n- Layout name input now focuses automatically when creating a layout\n- Added a warning before overwriting an existing layout with the same name\n\n### Lag Monitor\n\n- Moved Lag Monitor settings to the **Other** category\n- Added separate **Visibility** and **Design** configuration sections\n- Added configurable visibility for Dungeons, Hypixel outside Dungeons, and other multiplayer servers\n- Added options to individually show or hide TPS, ping, jitter, packet gap, diagnosis, the header, accent bar, and background\n- Added configurable background opacity and text shadow\n- The Lag Monitor HUD now automatically adjusts its layout based on which information is enabled\n- Replaced the old **Only Show in Dungeons** setting with the new location visibility options\n\n### Wiki\n\n- Significantly improved Wiki loading times\n- Removed live Auction House and Bazaar price lookups from Wiki pages, preventing market API requests from delaying page loading\n\n### Other\n- Fixed a bug in the dungeon code that occasionally caused the game to crash"
		}
